  "releaseNotes": "## v3.80.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v3.79.0:\n\n- Add a SessionStart hook for Claude Code cloud sessions (#713) (matt-edmondson)\n- Use Path.Join for the temporary PNG path in PngEncoderTests (Claude)\n- [minor] Move image decoding into ktsu.Imaging (Claude)\n- Read C++ raw string literals as one string [minor] (#742) (matt-edmondson)\n- Read HTML script and style bodies as text up to their closing tag [minor] (#741) (matt-edmondson)\n- Keep a backslashed quote inside a Python raw string [minor] (#740) (matt-edmondson)",
